# FinWise AI no longer reads an OpenAI API key from .env / environment
# variables. Each user enters their own key directly in the Streamlit
# sidebar ("Connect / Activate AI") -- it is kept only in that browser
# session's memory (st.session_state) and is never written to disk.

# Optional: override the default model (defaults to gpt-4o-mini if unset)
# FINWISE_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
